Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Noise readings from the user; lut_sweep
 --fans/--loads/--tag, CPU throttle under GPU load

research/noise_2026-10-09.txt: the user's phone-meter readings (300 rpm 57 dB,
1175 rpm 75-76 dB, 1550 rpm 79 dB), their words for 400-2800 rpm, and a fit of
about +30 dB per tenfold rpm. lut_sweep.py takes the fan speeds, loads and a tag
for a finer low-end sweep, and records the CPU's throttling during GPU load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
